window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Blood. Daggers.</b> <b>Golden chains.</b></p> <p>Katrin's nightmares have returned. This time, they are not visions of the past, but the present. His present.</p> <p>Castle Drakos hadn't been attacked since the ancient war. Until that day. The day everything changed. The day she became Queen. The day she barely escaped with her life in exchange for Alexander's.</p> <p>Now Katrin must work with the crew of <i>The Nostos</i> and several unlikely allies to not only rescue Alexander, but journey through the depths of Aidesian itself to prevent Hades from being resurrected.</p> <p>Because if King Athanas and the King of Harrenfort have their way, the fallen will rise.</p>"; 
